@startuml
title Research Worker Workflow

start
:Receive in-scope question from LangGraph;
:Invoke LangChain retrieval tool;

if (Query matches indexed terms?) then (yes)
    :Search ChromaDB for up to three passages;
    :Filter weak matches;
    :Collect evidence and citation IDs;
else (no)
    :Return an empty evidence list;
endif

:Build an extractive draft from the evidence;
:Return evidence and draft to LangGraph;
stop

@enduml